17 September 2019
Odd Einar Haugen: Introduced some corrections received from 
Ivar Berg to ch. 10.3.1.1; added the general description of ONPs orthographic norm in ch. 10.3.1.4;
added line division to the two normalised versions of the Old Icelandic sample; 
changed the colour of the rubric in the first sample to blue and inserted a note about this.
